

                      -----------------------------------
                      |      Change Mail Archiver       |
                      |---------------------------------|
                      |                                 |
                      |      (A) ARJ     (R) RAR        |
                      |      (L) LZH     (P) PAK        |
                      |      (Z) ZIP     (C) ARC        |
                      |                                 |
                      |---------------------------------|
                      |  Set this to the archiver that  |
                      |  you want the mail door to use  |
                      |  when making your mail packet.  |
                      -----------------------------------
